    "title": "If You Get 51/57 On These Quizzes, Your Eyes Can Only See Attention To Detail - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evelina Zaragoza Medina ,\n1 hours ago\nThese quizzes will certainly test your vision, but they'll also test your mind. Having 20/20 vision isn't going to help you unless you can tell what it is you're looking at. An exciting challenge, no? 1. If You Get 9/10 On This Quiz, Your Eyes Can Only See Attention To Detail These super zoomed-in photos will be harder to identify than you think. Take the quiz here .\nGetty Images 2. Fair Warning: Only Someone With A HUGE IQ And Perfect Vision Can Honestly Read These Words These words are literally chopped up into little pieces, but can you still read them? Take the quiz here .\nBuzzFeed 3. Sorry, But Only People With Perfect Eyesight Will Be Able To Find The Hidden Things In These Pictures I have to warn you that #18 (the snail) is impossible to find. Best of luck to you, though. Take the quiz here .\nReddit: Kaiserbun123 4. I'll Point Out These 12 TV And Film Continuity Errors, But First I Wanna See If You Can Find Them Yourself If you experience a perverse sense of joy when you saw that coffee cup in the last season of Game of Thrones , this is about to be your favorite quiz of all time. Take the quiz here .\nHBO Also in BuzzFeed: Your Brain Works In One Of Three Ways — Thinker, Solver, Or Doer — And This Quiz Will Reveal Which One\nAlso in BuzzFeed: 17 Very, Very, Very, Very, Very, Very Dark And Tragic Things I Just Learned About That Melted My Brain\nAlso in BuzzFeed: 17 Really, Really, Really, Really, Really, Really, Really, Really, Really, Really, Dark And Tragic Things I Just Learned About That Should Honestly Be Illegal To Know\nRead it on BuzzFeed.com",
